                                "sense_id": "0d6aeb5f-556b-3d0c-bd88-fe84fea59d8c",
                                "text": "He was wearing his high school ring, a Florida ring, an ugly garnet stone with a turd shape engraved on it—a manatee, the high school mascot— which caused Kiwi to look down at his own naked, knucklesome fingers in alarm."
